values ('men-of-movement-retreats', 'Men of Movement Retreats', 'retreat', 'published', 'In-person immersion, small group', 'Four days of movement, training, breathwork, ceremony and brotherhood with Mike and his team in Mount Shasta, California.', 'A live retreat: four days of movement, training, breathwork, ceremony and brotherhood with Mike and his team. The in-person version of everything the programs teach.

## What it is
Two cohorts a year in Mount Shasta, California. Mornings move, afternoons go inward, and evenings are fire, food and circle.

- Daily Qi Gong and team training
- Somatic breathwork ceremony
- Sweat lodge and rite of passage
- Full-board on private land

## After you get home
You leave with a take-home practice, a private brotherhood group and an integration call one week later.

## Common questions
**Do I need to be fit?** No. Everything is scalable in the moment.

**Is it a personal-development retreat or a training camp?** Both — the training is real, and so is the inner work.', array['Live, in person', 'Small groups', 'Movement, ceremony, recovery']::text[],
